S587 Lemma B fold-divisibility sieve, with Lemma A as control

PAIR-PINCH DIVISIBILITY FACT
  If D=a+b and t=m/D, then a*t+b*t=m.
  Any speed v with D|v has v*t in Z, so the D-pinch is shielded.
  The visible fold c=a+b is the special shield v=D; V*'s 24 shielding D=12 is the same gate.

